<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\惑星宝石箱.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\車内後部座席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Oh, I can see the sea!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So it is!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"About 10 more minutes to the inn. Good thing the weather's nice."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">At the wheel was </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and in the passenger seat, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">In the back seat, me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Today, the four of us were off on an overnight trip.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s souvenir... what should I get her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"For <STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE>, maybe cosmetics or something like that?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is actually pretty particular. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She's not happy unless it's something she picked out herself and likes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then maybe hot-spring manju or something... 
{PAUSE ""}
Oh, we're near the sea, so maybe seafood would be good too?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Today's trip was a present from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was Golden Week, after all, so she'd suggested a trip as a blood-related family.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had tried to politely decline, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had already made the reservation before hearing their answer.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">What's more, it was the finest room at a hot-spring inn, far too expensive to call a present...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Well, it's a crass thing to say, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> seems to be a company president, so maybe that kind of thing weighs less on her than on ordinary folks.</STYLE><PG>
"By the way, where's <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> gone?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"An amusement park in Megasawa, she said. A theme park that just opened last year, supposedly with the biggest grounds in Japan."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Wow... sounds fun, but it must be really crowded this time of year."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, same goes for us."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Today, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wasn't with us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When she heard about our trip, she threw a fit about wanting to come along, but then the Goto family decided to take a trip of their own, and it all worked out.</STYLE><PG>
"Still, is it really okay to build a theme park that big in a regional city like Megasawa?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, if there's one thing Megasawa has, it's a stupid amount of land."</STYLE><PG>
"Would anyone actually come all the way to Megasawa to have fun? 
{PAUSE ""}
Like, from Tokyo and places?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Who knows. Only whoever built it knows what they're thinking. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, we'll just take it easy and soak in the hot springs. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I hope the hot springs fix this eye too..."</STYLE><PG>
"So that eye's still bothering you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, obviously, right? Out of nowhere, just one eye turns green, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s or </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s!"</STYLE><PG>
"But the hospital didn't find anything wrong, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. They told me an injury can change your eye color, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Did you get hurt like that?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\幸太郎春花持ち上げ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Remember, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> pressed my head against the cave ceiling, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If that's the cause, I guess it's not impossible..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
But it's a pretty green, so I think it's nice."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey now... put yourself in my shoes. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's like my hair suddenly went blond and stood on end, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What are you, from some warrior race...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ever since we went to Arata, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s left eye had turned green, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s and the others'.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The hospital couldn't find the cause either, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> found her own eye creepy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But the people around her didn't make much of it. They figured it was just one of those things that happen when you're alive.</STYLE>
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\wave1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "600" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館外観2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">―We arrived at the inn by the sea.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It being Golden Week, the place was </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="にぎ">bustling</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with crowds.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The inn had two buildings, and with the one that seemed to be for guests, you couldn't even tell at a glance how many floors it had.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\海岸1.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">And the big sea, reflecting the clear blue of the May sky for all it was worth.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We'd probably be able to take in this whole view from our room, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Actually... this clearly isn't an inn ordinary folks get anywhere near...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館外観2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, you okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, I'm fine now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had been studying her eye on her phone the whole time since we talked about it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe that was why she'd gotten completely carsick.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Man, this inn is amazing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Nobody's ever taken me anywhere like this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... I feel bad, somehow."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, no, instead of feeling bad, just enjoy it all you can. I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will be happier that way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were both gazing up at the towering building, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="ぼうぜん">dumbfounded</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Apparently the inn was even fancier than they'd imagined.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "157" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館掛け軸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館家族風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Our room had its own private family bath, and it was two rooms at that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It had the kind of elegance that deserved to be called the best room.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So, what should we do now? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Um... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, calling me 'Mom'... You can keep things the way they've always been, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "300" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Right, right, same as always."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ha, ha ha ha... yeah, you're right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Oh! I'm gonna go explore the inn by myself for a bit!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hurried out of the room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It seemed she felt a little out of place after all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> is uncomfortable with it after all, isn't she..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, that's just for now. She'll get used to it soon enough."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治横顔逆.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\reciever1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> said that, then picked up the receiver of the room phone.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ah, hello? Two beers, please. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">You guys want anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> apparently meant to start his evening drink right away.</STYLE><PG>
"I'm good for now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I'll... just have a little of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was 2 o'clock in the afternoon.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We'd just had lunch, and the expensive-looking tea in the room was plenty for me.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
"Hey... I heard a little about what happened in Megasawa..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I said that, the two of them looked startled.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Right... we should tell you properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The two of them sat down facing me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\旅館部屋広縁.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s adoption, and how it came about―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">Haruka's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s accident―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What happened in Megasawa City―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">They told me all of it, without trying to hide a thing.</STYLE><PG>
"I see... So everything turned out for the best."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had asked for a murder, and the two of them had been torn right up until the last moment. Hearing that, I was naturally a little thrown.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But the two of them had avoided a tragedy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That was enough.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Pardon me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">There was a knock at the door, and an inn attendant came in.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank you very much for honoring our inn with your visit today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The attendant bowed </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="うやうや">reverently</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, with her fingertips to the floor.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Here is what you ordered."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\ビール.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s beer arrived, and with it, complimentary edamame with big, plump beans.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ビール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Once the attendant left the room, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> silently poured his own beer.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Back then, if </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="4"> hadn't said you were coming along, there's no telling what would have happened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I could see </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> was suffering, and I really wanted to do something for her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\ビール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">This time, it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s glass that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> filled with beer.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I can understand a little of how </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> felt.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ever asked me to do something like that...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even supposing </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had committed murder 10 years ago, I don't think I could truly despise them or feel ashamed of them.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But happiness piled up on top of that kind of misfortune is surely a </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="もろ">fragile</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> thing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A second or a third incident could even have happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm truly glad these two are my parents.</STYLE><PG>
"I'm going to go look for <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
