{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Leaving </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> alone too much would also go against what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka's mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wanted.</STYLE><PG>
