<STYLE ID="3">―I left the room and went around checking places </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> might be.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Still, it really was a huge, magnificent inn.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">One wrong turn and I'd probably get lost.</STYLE><PG>
