already gotten lost..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">After getting on and off the elevator over and over, I wasn't even sure anymore which floor our room was on.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">On top of that, I'd left my phone in the room.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe the only thing for it now is to go to the front desk and ask. Embarrassing as it is...</STYLE><PG>
