{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Both of us getting lost at the same time... we really are sisters."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> looked out at the sea with a smile.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Her profile―I gazed at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s left eye.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">An eye every bit as clear as the sea below.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That green was like the deep sea, like the high sky, and like the </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="も">budding</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> forests of May.</STYLE><PG>
"Even sisters hardly ever get lost at the same time."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then we're more than sisters!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">We're sisters, and best friends.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No, we're a rare pair who were best friends before we were ever sisters.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I looked at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s profile once more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">This person</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is my older sister. It doesn't feel real at all...</STYLE><PG>
"Earlier, I heard about how <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> saved me 10 years ago. 
{PAUSE ""}
Thank you for back then. 
{PAUSE ""}
And... I'm sorry."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
