<STYLE ID="6">Squeeeze!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The phone screen showed almost nothing but people's silhouettes, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s voice got hard to hear.</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ青ストラップ切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">While all that was going on, the call cut off by itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, being </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, had apparently gotten lost too, but it seems that in pointless little ways like this, we're alike, sisters or not.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, looks like they're having fun over there in their own way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But calling us like that... she was probably a little lonely after all, don't you think?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-well, they do say that with trips, who you go with matters more than where you go. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is with her own family anyway..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, see, <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> is practically family to us already, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Next time we get a chance to travel, let's take <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE> along too."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. You really do need a character like </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to spice things up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Are you... complimenting <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE>?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Didn't it sound like one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's a matter of nuance... maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
　Ah, but I'd rather not do hot springs with <STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The truth is, when </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I took a bath together in Arata, I saw.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家風呂.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島風呂うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, for all her childlike shortness, had something far more impressive than mine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At the time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was busy deducing, so she didn't say anything, but if </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> ever gets carried away, she's sure to make fun of my figure.</STYLE><PG>
