{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The sense of oneness I'd shared at the mountain hut in Arata with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> I'd gladly go to a hot spring with, but with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we'll stay somewhere with no hot spring.</STYLE><PG>
